# Regression guards are tracked (they used to be hidden by a `test_*.mjs`
# ignore rule, so CI never ran them):
#   test_index_search.mjs     - index hit rate, offline
#   test_zero_github_calls.mjs- real bundled Worker vs a fetch stub that 403s
#                               api.github.com; the assertion that matters here
#                               is that nothing reaches GitHub at all.
# These three predate that harness: they re-implement the logic inline instead
# of importing it, so they pass even when the Worker is wrong.
/test_search.mjs
/test_manifest.mjs
/test_rewrite.mjs
